00:30:30.728 --> 00:30:32.130
Because it's happening.

00:30:32.130 --> 00:30:34.399 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's not a question
at this point.

00:30:34.399 --> 00:30:38.036 align:start size:84% position:16%
And this should be
alarming for everybody

00:30:38.036 --> 00:30:40.505
