the American people,

00:32:32.383 --> 00:32:34.919 align:start size:97% position:3%
our security in our country
with these decisions.

00:32:34.919 --> 00:32:36.020
- So with that in mind,

00:32:36.020 --> 00:32:37.789
if we were to flashback to say,

00:32:37.789 --> 00:32:39.290
you know, what is it,

00:32:39.290 --> 00:32:40.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
