00:35:17.482 --> 00:35:19.050
That was once the ACLU,

00:35:19.050 --> 00:35:20.184
the defender of free speech.

00:35:20.184 --> 00:35:22.086
So that's actually a good segue

00:35:22.086 --> 00:35:24.021 align:start size:97% position:3%
