00:35:36.067 --> 00:35:37.535
the whole freaking thing,
what is going on here?

00:35:37.535 --> 00:35:39.103
- The whole freaking thing.

00:35:40.705 --> 00:35:41.939
I judged throughout.

00:35:41.939 --> 00:35:43.808
So for those who don't know,

00:35:45.243 --> 00:35:48.346
I filed a lawsuit against
Google because frankly,

00:35:48.346 --> 00:35:52.583
