elections through my campaign,

00:35:52.583 --> 00:35:54.185
it was something that I
experienced personally

00:35:54.185 --> 00:35:55.486 align:start size:84% position:16%
when I was first
running for president.

00:35:55.486 --> 00:35:57.655
I knew there were
a lot of people

00:35:57.655 --> 00:35:59.824 align:start size:84% position:16%
in this country who
didn't know who I was.

00:35:59.824 --> 00:36:02.493
And I hoped that, you know,

00:36:02.493 --> 00:36:04.829 align:start size:97% position:3%
by going and standing on the
presidential debate stage

00:36:04.829 --> 00:36:07.798
