00:36:07.798 --> 00:36:09.567 align:start size:88% position:13%
She might be saying
some interesting things.

00:36:09.567 --> 00:36:10.801 align:start size:81% position:19%
How do we find out
more about her?

00:36:10.801 --> 00:36:13.371 align:start size:88% position:13%
So we set up a Google
Ads account in the hopes

00:36:13.371 --> 00:36:14.939
