00:36:25.082 --> 00:36:26.617
But in that first debate,

00:36:26.617 --> 00:36:30.121 align:start size:97% position:3%
what ended up happening
afterwards is Google suspended

00:36:30.121 --> 00:36:32.256 align:start size:84% position:16%
