any explanation,

00:36:32.256 --> 00:36:34.192
without any warning.

00:36:34.192 --> 00:36:35.826
Our tech team obviously
got on it right away

00:36:35.826 --> 00:36:37.128 align:start size:84% position:16%
and they were trying
to figure out,

00:36:37.128 --> 00:36:38.563
okay, what did we do wrong?

00:36:38.563 --> 00:36:39.764
How do we fix this?

00:36:39.764 --> 00:36:41.432 align:start size:84% position:16%
How do we bring
this account back up

00:36:41.432 --> 00:36:42.733
so it's not suspended anymore?

00:36:42.733 --> 00:36:44.101
Didn't get a response.

00:36:44.101 --> 00:36:46.304
And then I don't know
how long it was later,

00:36:46.304 --> 00:36:48.406 align:start size:84% position:16%
but finally the
account was reinstated

00:36:48.406 --> 00:36:50.074 align:start size:88% position:13%
without any
explanation whatsoever.

00:36:50.074 --> 00:36:52.109
So obviously this had
a very negative impact

00:36:52.109 --> 00:36:55.146 align:start size:84% position:16%
on what I was
trying to accomplish

00:36:55.146 --> 00:36:56.847 align:start size:88% position:13%
in my campaign and being
able to reach people.

00:36:56.847 --> 00:36:59.617 align:start size:88% position:13%
But we filed the lawsuit
