00:37:11.963 --> 00:37:14.065
The point is that you
have this monopoly

00:37:14.065 --> 00:37:16.901 align:start size:84% position:16%
and this major
massive tech company

00:37:16.901 --> 00:37:19.203 align:start size:84% position:16%
that has the
ability to interfere

00:37:19.203 --> 00:37:21.339
