office in this country,

00:37:28.779 --> 00:37:31.115 align:start size:88% position:13%
the most powerful
office in this country.

00:37:31.115 --> 00:37:33.351
And so if they could do
that to a sitting member

00:37:33.351 --> 00:37:35.720 align:start position:0%
