president of the United States,

00:37:35.720 --> 00:37:39.056 align:start size:84% position:16%
just imagine what they
could do to anyone,

00:37:39.056 --> 00:37:43.361
anywhere, for any reason to
serve their own interest.

00:37:43.361 --> 00:37:45.529
And so that was the
crux of the lawsuit.

00:37:45.529 --> 00:37:48.599
We filed the lawsuit,
a judge tossed it out.

00:37:48.599 --> 00:37:52.970 align:start position:0%
But as we have seen now in those
years since there have been

00:37:52.970 --> 00:37:55.206 align:start size:88% position:13%
more and more
revelations coming from

00:37:55.206 --> 00:37:57.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
and about these different
big tech companies,

00:37:57.375 --> 00:38:01.412 align:start size:84% position:16%
how they have directly
sought to undermine

00:38:01.412 --> 00:38:04.448 align:start size:88% position:13%
and interfere, frankly,
in our democracy,

00:38:04.448 --> 00:38:06.183
not to speak of all
the censorship stuff,

00:38:06.183 --> 00:38:09.353
that's a whole other
parallel conversation.

00:38:09.353 --> 00:38:12.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
- So when you see the
Twitter files get dumped,

00:38:12.757 --> 00:38:14.425 align:start size:84% position:16%
and now you've
already gone through

00:38:14.425 --> 00:38:16.060
this as you just laid out.

00:38:16.060 --> 00:38:17.295
- Kudos to Elon Musk for that.

00:38:17.295 --> 00:38:18.262
- Right?

00:38:18.262 --> 00:38:19.530
Absolutely. Absolutely.

00:38:19.530 --> 00:38:20.765
I mean, here's one guy,

00:38:20.765 --> 00:38:22.800
all he's saying is,
hey, free speech.

00:38:22.800 --> 00:38:23.968
And of course now we're watching

00:38:23.968 --> 00:38:25.202
the entire machine call him

00:38:25.202 --> 00:38:27.571 align:start size:84% position:16%
a white supremacist
and god knows

00:38:27.571 --> 00:38:28.839 align:start size:84% position:16%
what else they're
saying about the guy.

00:38:28.839 --> 00:38:32.076
But when you watch all
of this get exposed,

00:38:32.076 --> 00:38:34.211
is this another case of, okay,

